{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roll the dice but make your own luck in this 2D dicebuilding roguelike. Customize your dice using swappable faces, runes, and bodies with unique effects. \u200bDraft spells, create powerful synergies, defeat challenging enemies, and conquer the Archon's palace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/extras/53ab7b0cadcb27a11bfa6a54697322eb.avif?t=1754064770\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/extras/c36739f23eb782daa1a56303822a6e8e.poster.avif?t=1754064770\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/extras/c36739f23eb782daa1a56303822a6e8e.webm?t=1754064770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RNG in dice games can be less than fun... but fortunately for you, you can stack the dice in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/extras/e29c6ec1f525213ed908c62d0905c65c.avif?t=1754064770\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/extras/5547518ac08fbb607ea915f11fbd90c7.poster.avif?t=1754064770\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/extras/5547518ac08fbb607ea915f11fbd90c7.webm?t=1754064770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>In the demo:</i></strong> Play as the Gaiamancer, with over 50 spells available<strong><i></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>In the full game:</i></strong> Play as the Gaiamancer, the Pyromancer, or the Thaumancer (or even a secret fourth character). Each mage has their own unique spells to choose from, over 200 spells in total! But spells alone won't be enough to get you through the palace to find the Archon Soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/extras/caa0b133a219469f5b2f295bf2a12ffe.avif?t=1754064770\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/extras/dfa41c8f4ce816c557042dd3010159e0.poster.avif?t=1754064770\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/extras/dfa41c8f4ce816c557042dd3010159e0.webm?t=1754064770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>In the demo:</i>\u00a0</strong> 15 dice bodies (plus event only dice bodies) and 25 runes available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>In the full game:</i></strong>\u00a0In addition to changing the face values of your dice, you can also modify them with Dice Bodies and Runes to add synergies with your spells along with other interesting abilities. With 40 runes and over 30 dice bodies, each dice has over 65,000 combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/extras/bacdd43b3c58edb734d1d4fe180daa8a.avif?t=1754064770\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/extras/e8bf0a8946c4f5511fecdee4d739219b.poster.avif?t=1754064770\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/extras/e8bf0a8946c4f5511fecdee4d739219b.webm?t=1754064770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the Archon's palace, choose your path, engage in combat, encounter events, defeat powerful bosses, and fight your way through 4 acts to make your way to the Archon Soul. Can you prove your worth to the Soul, and become one with its power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill testing and strategic roguelike gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 playable characters to choose from <strong><i>(In the full game)</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200 spells <strong><i>(In the full game)</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40 dice runes and over 30 dice bodies <strong><i>(In the full game)</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of unique enemies to challenge your play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful illustrated artwork by Anais Lehoux and Natalya Samutina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soundtrack by Ofelia Argiro</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904010?t=1754064770","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/87e09cbd6a011a92d722e8f77f084a4215783979/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754064770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/f4480894ed4495215df317b9d880ce591536961a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754064770","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904010/f4480894ed